            "navigation_label": "ZWIFT App",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Connect with ZWIFT APP",
            "content": "<p>Step 1: Turn your treadmill on, and launch Zwift.<br/><br/>Step 2:Select the type of running in the ZWIFT APP<br/><br/>Step 3:Connecting WELLFIT TM Linker<br/><br/>Step 4:Select your Zwift workout by clicking the blue Training icon under Run type.<br/><br/>Step 5:Click workout.<br/><br/>Step 6: You're ready to run!</p>"
