            "subheading": "No subscription fees",
            "title": "Connect with WELLFIT",
            "content": "<p>STEP 1: Turn on the Bluetooth and location on your phone.</p><p>STEP 2: Pair with Treadmill.</p><p>STEP 3: Add device.</p><p>STEP 4: Choose your program you need.</p>"
